report={'review':'Independent post-accounting current-document accuracy review; static only','feature':'133','reviewer':'/root/validator133','attempt':1,'limit':3,'root_release':base,'reviewed_commit':revision,'documents':{p:sha((root/p).read_bytes()) for p in paths},'confirmed':['Exactly six authorized files changed. Five NDS versions/dates and both frontmatter schemas pass; old change_log entries/history bodies are unchanged. Featurelist differs solely by spec_version0.1.3. Every existing debt row, all Resolved body and the two Open IDs remain byte-identical; only dated cost observation is inserted, no new ID or program.','Exact immutable scope report291a25 binds endpoint462f30f2.1493+1299=2792; selectmax(2792,3024)=3024, never sum. Original2000/2600 fails by424. Product414=83source/docs+331tests, process2610 versus1400; firstfeature has no prior rolling baseline. These are checks of existing receipts, not a scope rerun.','Rootstate delivery_exception is explicitly bounded current delivery under standing delegation; failed budget flags and original allowance remain. Future allocations, rebaseline and other-phase gate waivers are not granted. Subsequent measurement/currentdocs/CI/merge administration is separately retained beyond immutable endpoint; legacy018916 endpoint administration and later terminal work stay distinct, archived018 unchanged.','Old PR104 main reportd671371d and actual retained terminal-run/jobs frames bind run38817712498/headc8 completed success/allfive at00:24:45Z. Current views accurately limit this to oldSource. New133 exact-head PR/merge/main remain pending, no new PR claimed; original observer/parser failures remain retained.','Previously corrected default48+aux versus fixturetwo+aux/166files/newfour, mixed QA revisions/eight selected0/nine mandatory with originalfailure/exactoneextra, localcapture14645/239, Source5f and old123 historical proof boundary remain unchanged. No elapsed-time/comparative/runtime/newrelease or install claim.','NormativeDAG/originalallowances/partial016/future020and019 and heldfuturepreparation stay separate. No Source/tests/installed/Rootstate/contract/canonical lifecycle/manifest change or fresh tests/CI/install/model/benchmark/interimaccounting execution.'],'evidence':{'scope_report':{'path':scopepath,'sha256':sha(scopebytes)},'old_main_report':{'path':mainpath,'sha256':sha(mainbytes)},'static_frame':'/home/cnross/.tmp/nizam-133-post-accounting-review1/review.execution.json','static_stdout':'/home/cnross/.tmp/nizam-133-post-accounting-review1/review.stdout.txt','diff_check_pid':p.pid,'diff_check_actual_exit':p.returncode},'final_verdict':{'approved':True,'summary':'Approve factual post-accounting projections and bounded current-delivery disposition; immutable costs, preserved histories and old/new integration boundaries are accurately distinguished.'},'issues':[],'missing_acceptance_coverage':[],'unsupported_claims':[]}
for schema in ('schema/contract_review.schema.json','.nizam/schema/contract_review.schema.json'):jsonschema.Draft202012Validator(json.loads((root/schema).read_text())).validate(report)
target=root/'.agent/validator/133-post-accounting-docs1.json';assert not target.exists();target.write_text(json.dumps(report,indent=2)+chr(10));print(json.dumps(dict(verdict_sha256=sha(target.read_bytes()),both_verdict_schemas_valid=True,scope_receipt_arithmetic_verified_without_remeasurement=True,six_file_scope=True,histories_debt_rows_preserved=True,old_main_all_five_success_verified=True,approved=True),sort_keys=True))
